  "prefLabel": "Nat 602.01 Ethical Standards for Naturopaths",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nat 602.01 Ethical Standards for Naturopaths. The ethical standards for naturopaths shall be the APTA Code of Ethics for the American Association of Naturopathic Physicians’ (AANP) Code of Ethics, approved as a full code of ethics August 2012 and as referenced in Appendix II.\n\nSource. #13140, eff 11-26-20",
